$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot 2=\\frac{3}{2}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f4645490-4961-5a1e-9ae3-88ccb9bec06b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f4645490-4961-5a1e-9ae3-88ccb9bec06b" :question/answer-fields "ced10082-f000-5a52-9d26-469ef3fe713a"] [:db/ensure "f4645490-4961-5a1e-9ae3-88ccb9bec06b" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "f4645490-4961-5a1e-9ae3-88ccb9bec06b"] [:db/add "e48839bb-a08d-553d-a166-44a9e81381cb" :answer/id #uuid "e48839bb-a08d-553d-a166-44a9e81381cb"] [:db/add "e48839bb-a08d-553d-a166-44a9e81381cb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e48839bb-a08d-553d-a166-44a9e81381cb" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e48839bb-a08d-553d-a166-44a9e81381cb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "e37eec64-6d81-5a37-805b-2334fba3f964" :answer/id #uuid "e37eec64-6d81-5a37-805b-2334fba3f964"] [:db/add "e37eec64-6d81-5a37-805b-2334fba3f964" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e37eec64-6d81-5a37-805b-2334fba3f964" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e37eec64-6d81-5a37-805b-2334fba3f964" :answer/validate] [:db/add "85ced902-7e5b-5863-b87a-db75f313d705" :answer/id #uuid "85ced902-7e5b-5863-b87a-db75f313d705"] [:db/add "85ced902-7e5b-5863-b87a-db75f313d705" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "85ced902-7e5b-