7b-0143caf1ec14" :question/id #uuid "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14"] [:db/add "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{4}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{4}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14" :question/answer-fields "d56a72bc-d1a2-5c31-89aa-ed31f2db491b"] [:db/ensure "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "11b24a5c-cc96-5edb-a57b-0143caf1ec14"] [:db/add "52cfadef-31f4-5a14-a352-b40bcaffdc83" :answer/id #uuid "52cfadef-31f4-5a14-a352-b40bcaffdc83"] [:db/add "52cfadef-31f4-5a14-a352-b40bcaffdc83" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "52cfadef-31f4-5a14-a352-b40bcaffdc83" :answer/value "\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}+C"] [:db/ensure "52cfadef-31f4-5a14-a352-b40bcaffdc83" :answer/validate] [:db/add "db39502e-7b4f-5ae9-b5bf-8832191681b0" :answ