s $\\mathrm{d}x=5\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{25}\\cdot 5=\\frac{3}{5}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "a54a704d-0604-583c-9a79-ad7771ee3a92" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "a54a704d-0604-583c-9a79-ad7771ee3a92" :question/answer-fields "fc6bdcd4-f3bd-51e3-8051-1406462241a8"] [:db/ensure "a54a704d-0604-583c-9a79-ad7771ee3a92" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "a54a704d-0604-583c-9a79-ad7771ee3a92"] [:db/add "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc" :answer/id #uuid "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc"] [:db/add "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc" :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc" :answer/validate] [:db/add "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59" :answer/id #uuid "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59"] [:db/add "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59" :answer/validate] [:db/add "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322" :answer/id #uuid "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322"] [:db/add "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{2 x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657" :answer/id #uuid "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657"] [:db/add "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657" :answer/validate] [:db/add "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b" :answer/id #uuid "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b"] [:db/add "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b" :answer/value "\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/id #uuid "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/choices "2a34f19d-e1e0-5037-b8b6-8b91237539bc"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/choices "10652b96-1c98-5d6a-b88e-5615c48f9f59"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/choices "8f6e7476-7343-5864-a233-ad2f35780322"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/choices "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/choices "27dcbd12-e676-5752-9e1b-97852310195b"] [:db/add "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/correct "c32d8665-4c48-545b-aaa4-e8bfca5a1657"] [:db/ensure "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/id #uuid "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378"] [:db/add "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 9=9\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{3})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot 3=\\frac{2}{3}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 9}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/answer-fields "5529bbbd-486c-5333-b3f0-c2b0966c6906"] [:db/ensure "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "04273c07-61db-5c6f-ab5e-ed62a376e378"] [:db/add "cf7f9bd4-3000-552f-86c9-f8421db9c068" :answer/id #uuid "cf7f9bd4-3000-552f-86c9-f8421db9c068"] [:db/add "cf7f9bd4-3000-552f-86c9-f8421db9c068" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cf7f9bd4-3000-552f-86c9-f8421db9c068" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "cf7f9bd4-3000-552f-86c9-f8421db9c068" :answer/validate] [:db/add "2872334f-71fb-5bb6-bfd5-1d2597cdc370" :answer/id #uuid "2872334f-71fb-5bb6-bfd5-1d2597