hoice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant."] [:db/add "3fcdfdfc-02d3-5240-acf8-6d2463fd38f7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{4 x}{5}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{4}{5})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n16 x^{2} + 25=25\\left(1+(\\frac{4 x}{5})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{5}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{25}\\cdot \\frac{5}{4}=\\frac{3}{20}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{3}{16 x^{2} + 25}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{20}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{4 x}{5} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "3fcdfdfc-02d3-5240-acf8-6d2463fd38f7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "3fcdfdfc-02d3-5240-acf8-6d2463fd38f7" :question/answer-fields "b35235ad-dc60-54fd-b6c8-a9f265e7bb94"] [:db/ensure "3fcdfdfc-02d3-5240-acf8-6d2463fd38f7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "3fcdfdfc-02d3-5240-acf8-6d2463fd38f7"] [:db/add "e67e530c-d28e-54f4-8748-5520d3b08f18" :answer/id #uuid "e67e530c-d28e-54f4-8748-5520d3b08f18"] [:db/add "e67e530c-d28e-54f4-8748-5520d3b08f18" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "e67e530c-d28e-54f4-8748-5520d3b08f18" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "e67e530c-d28e-54f4-8748-5520d3b08f18" :answer/validate] [:db/add "28ade528-30f0-5553-8e66-9ea3e481b310" :answer/id #uuid "28ade528-30f0-5553-8e66-9ea3e481b310"] [:db/add "28ade528-30f0-5553-8e66-9ea3e481b310" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "28ade528-30f0-5553-8e66-9ea3e481b310" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "28a