\left(1+(\\frac{3 x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{4}{3}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}=\\frac{1}{6}$.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\frac{2}{9 x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the supplied primitive:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{4} \\right)}\\right)+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "e0709212-5bdd-58e3-9994-272e5bc71470" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "e0709212-5bdd-58e3-9994-272e5bc71470" :question/answer-fields "3e4e95df-caf6-5361-91ae-90efa9338dbb"] [:db/ensure "e0709212-5bdd-58e3-9994-272e5bc71470" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064219 :knowledge-point/questions "e0709212-5bdd-58e3-9994-272e5bc71470"] [:db/add "83cf66b3-5ed6-50d4-9274-88b625dd6f55" :answer/id #uuid "83cf66b3-5ed6-50d4-9274-88b625dd6f55"] [:db/add "83cf66b3-5ed6-50d4-9274-88b625dd6f55" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "83cf66b3-5ed6-50d4-9274-88b625dd6f55" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{6}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "83cf66b3-5ed6-50d4-9274-88b625dd6f55" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5dae9b1b-02f7-56df-bda5-d9430830fa85" :answer/id #uuid "5dae9b1b-02f7-56df-bda5-d9430830fa85"] [:db/add "5dae9b1b-02f7-56df-bda5-d9430830fa85" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5dae9b1b-02f7-56df-bda5-d9430830fa85" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\arctan{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{2} \\right)}\\right)+C"] [:db/ensure "5dae9b1b-02f7-56df-bda5-d9430830fa85" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dc439a9b-733f-5aaa-99a4-c9ce25be3862" :answer/id #uuid "dc439a9b-733f-5aaa-99a4-c9ce25be3862"] [:db/add "dc439a9b-733f-5aaa-99a4-c9ce25be3862" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dc